      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate experienced a gross prior year strengthening of GBP 19.252 million, calculated from the claims development triangle, indicating adverse development in older underwriting years. This contrasts with the reported net favourable development of GBP 3.9 million, which was attributed to releases in Third Party Liability and Aviation, partially offset by strengthening in Other direct. The syndicate also released a net reserve of GBP 2.0 million related to COVID-19 pandemic claims from 2020. Inflationary pressures were noted as a factor leading to adjustments in current held reserves.",
